Added a `NATURAL_SLUG_ENABLED` settings flag (default `True`, environment variable `NAUTOBOT_NATURAL_SLUG_ENABLED`). When set to `False`, Nautobot skips deriving the `natural_slug` value entirely — a measurable per-object cost on large REST API list responses, CSV exports, and webhook payloads. The `natural_slug` REST API field remains present for schema compatibility but renders as an empty string, and the UI "Advanced" panel omits the value.
